<span class="new-centered-article-text">
    On the back of the short you will find a yoke with cut lines that are similar to a 5 pocket jean. The yoke has two snap closure welt pockets that integrate to the seam that runs across the top half of the backside of the short. Besides swimming we use the Camp Hero Short as a daily runner and take it out on the soccer field as well because of how lightweight and highly breathable it is. A reflective heat transfer logo hit replaces the original embroidery this season for night visibility. 
</span>


